; wound_immunity         – resistance to bullets, claws, cutting / piercing damage
; radiation_immunity     – resistance to radiation exposure
; telepatic_immunity     – resistance to psy / telepathic attacks (Controller, Burer)
; chemical_burn_immunity – resistance to toxic gas / chemical anomalies
; explosion_immunity     – resistance to explosion shockwaves (grenades, rockets)
; fire_wound_immunity    – resistance to shrapnel / explosive fragments


